  triage:title "AI40-CLEANUP-QA-3: cleanup PR grows tracked site/reports/ instead of shrinking it" ;
  triage:description "PR #713 (fix/ai40-benchmark-results-cleanup @ 372a7d10) is intended to clean up benchmark evidence retention bloat, but site/reports/send-message-benchmark/ grew from 28 timestamp groups/84 tracked files to 32 groups/96 files (added 4 new m5-arm64-01 groups from the QA-8 fix round, deleted none of the original 25 mac-arm64-01 or 3 original m5 groups). Confirmed via git ls-tree on origin/fix/ai40-benchmark-results-cleanup: 96 tracked files under site/reports/send-message-benchmark. arch-ctm's report that 26 historic raw inputs were restored only under gitignored artifacts/benchmark/historic-raw/ is accurate but misleading by omission -- the tracked site/reports/ tree itself was never pruned. Gitignore boundary and narrow-scope items both PASS per quality-mgr; this is the sole remaining gap." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AI" ;
